<title>HONG KONG: China Int'l Marine sets US$40 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>China Int'l Marine sets US$40 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger Societe Generale Asia.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CHINA INTERNATIONAL MARINE CONTAINERS (GROUP) CO LTD</p>
<p> AMOUNT     US$40 MLN  COUPON	6ML+100   MATURITY  5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	  ISS PRICE   PAR	 LAUNCH    19.MAR.97</p>
<p> PUTS	 YR 3	 CALLS	 NONE	REPLIES   17.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	 REPAYMENT   BULLET    DENOMS    $250K</p>
<p> RATING     NONE	 SALE LMTS   STANDARD  TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	  CRS DEF     YES	 FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> HOME CTRY  CHINA	GOV LAW     HK	  PAY DATE  --</p>
<p> MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>   CO-ARRANGERS	US$8 MLN+   35BP   ALL-IN  111.66</p>
<p>   SENIOR MANAGERS   US$5 MLN    25BP   ALL-IN  108.33</p>
<p>   MANAGERS	    US$3 MLN    20BP   ALL-IN  106.66</p>
<p> ARRANGER  SOCIETE GENERALE ASIA</p>
<p> NOTE	THERE IS A FINANCIAL COVENANT STATING THAT THE</p>
<p>	     BORROWER MUST HAVE A MINIMUM NET WORTH OF</p>
<p>	     RMB 500 MLN, AND MAXIMUM DEBT TO EQUITY OF 2.5 TO 1.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
